\paragraph{State-reward distribution analysis.}
To illustrate the advantages of CDiffuser more intuitively, we randomly collect the (state, reward) pairs from the offline dataset of Walker2d-Med-Replay and the (state, reward) pairs collected when CDiffuser and CDiffuser-C interact with the environment. 
